## NRD State Examples

| NRD State | Interpretation |
|-----------|----------------|
| `Who is this?` | Reader has no identity anchor for the writer |
| `So what?` | Claim made; relevance to reader not yet established |
| `Can you deliver?` | Credibility implied but not demonstrated |
| `Why me?` | Writer hasn't connected the ask to this reader specifically |
| `WOW.` | Positive debt — writer delivered more than expected |
| Blank / none | Debt paid; expectation fulfilled |

